# As any player who just changed dimension, through the advancement of this name, revoked to fire again.
# A runner is marked for refresh_supporting_block, before their next check: run here, it would teleport them
# from inside the portal's own teleport.
advancement revoke @s only kalic0re:parkour/player/changed_dimension
execute if score @s kalic0re.parkour.isActive matches 1 run tag @s add kalic0re.parkour.runnerChangedDimension
